  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can bridge the gap between minds and invade those that invade yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mindworm<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the save DC against your ability to detect thoughts on a creature that has created a mind-affecting effect, and the time within which you can use this ability is increased to a number of minutes equal to your Wisdom modifier plus your mythic tier, or an equivalent number of hours if you expend one use of your mythic power.</p>\n<p>If you establish a Mindlink with that creature, you add your mythic tier to the DC of Sense Motive checks made to detect your mental intrusion, and if you expend one use of your mythic power you may add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the save DC of the listed spells used against that creature. Your Mindlink can penetrate non-mythic effects that block divinations if you succeed in a Wisdom check, adding your mythic tier and the number of points in your ki pool as a bonus, against a DC of 15 plus the caster level of the effect (or the caster level check DC, if the spell already allows one).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
